    "context_html": "<section class=\"hero split\"><div><p class=\"eyebrow\">Good coffee. Better company.</p><h1 class=\"display\">Your usual,<br/>with a little<br/>extra time.</h1><p class=\"intro\">A neighbourhood cafe for slow mornings and second cups. Drop in, settle down, stay awhile.</p><p>Our warm cafe interior features pendant lights and a large CAFE sign above the counter.</p><div class=\"actions\"><a class=\"btn\" href=\"#menu\">Explore the menu</a></div></div><img alt=\"\" class=\"photo tall\" id=\"target\" src=\"../assets/coffee.jpg\"/></section>",
